      justification: "libpdx-argv.M4-001 case12 — mixed flag+positional interleaved. Verifies parser preserves argv order semantics: both flags land in flag_names/ids (in argv order — verbose then quiet), both positionals land in pos_ptrs (in argv order — foo then bar). Consumers dispatching by find_flag_by_id get the right IDs regardless of interleave.",
